WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.310
Hours help you remember how much time

2
00:00:02.345 --> 00:00:02.961
you spent.

3
00:00:03.599 --> 00:00:06.432
Stories help you remember why the experience

4
00:00:06.490 --> 00:00:06.954
mattered.

5
00:00:07.454 --> 00:00:09.485
Start with one specific moment.

6
00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:12.910
Describe what happened, what you noticed, and

7
00:00:12.957 --> 00:00:14.454
what changed in your thinking.

8
00:00:14.954 --> 00:00:17.369
That small reflection becomes evidence you can

9
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:21.015
use in advising conversations, applications, and future

10
00:00:21.049 --> 00:00:21.676
decisions.

